cription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-02-08T12:26:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T11:20:51Z","closed_at":"2025-03-05T11:20:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Issue Description**\nWhen I press F5 or F6 to run the project, the Godot game preview window freezes. Sometimes, it crashes completely; other times, it does not, but I have to forcefully close it using the Task Manager.\nAdditionally, if the software does not crash, dragging the preview window leaves significant ghosting artifacts.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce**\n1,Create a Sprite2D node.\n2.Add icon.svg as its texture.\n3.Create a Node and name it main.\n4.Attach a script (main.gd) to main with the following content:\n```\nextends Node\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    var scene_resource = load(\"res://sprite.tscn\")\n    var root_node = scene_resource.instantiate()\n    self.add_child(root_node)\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n    pass\n```\n5.Press F5 or F6 to run the project.\n6.The preview window freezes or crashes. If it does not crash, dragging the window causes extreme ghosting.\n\n**Godot Version**\nAffected version: Godot 4.4 Beta3\n\n**Comparison with Beta2:** \nThe issue does not occur in Godot 4.4 Beta2, and there are no ghosting artifacts in that version.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":